ARTICLES['club-home'].body=`<p>Saturday matches, muddy boots, and a place for every player. We are Riverdale Thunder, a youth soccer club in Lexington.</p><h2>This week at Thunder</h2><ul><li><a href="#/article/thunder-weekly">From the touchline: saves, passing drills & a crossbar champion</a> — 25 October</li><li><a href="#/article/recap">Community Cup: thank you, Lexington</a> — 24 October</li><li><a href="#/article/organizer">Volunteer follow-up and receipt deadline</a> — 25 October</li><li><a href="#/article/current">2026 Community Cup announcement</a> — 12 October</li></ul><h2>Meet a few of the squad</h2><div class="squad-grid">${['zoe','mateo','harper','casey'].map(id=>`<a href="#/profile/${id}">${id==='casey'?`<img src="assets/casey.jpg" alt="Casey Selvin">`:`<span class="squad-face team-avatar" role="img" aria-label="${PROFILES[id].name}" style="--face-x:${id==='zoe'?'28%':id==='mateo'?'50%':'77%'}"></span>`}<strong>${PROFILES[id].name}</strong><span>@${PROFILES[id].handle}</span></a>`).join('')}</div><h2>Around the clubhouse</h2><p>Boot swap on Sunday. Bring clean boots you have outgrown. Ask Coach K about joining a practice session, or catch up with the team on <a href="#/profile/thunder">Frame @riverdale_thunder</a>.</p>`;
ARTICLES['thunder-weekly']={service:'club',title:'From the touchline',date:'25 October 2026 · Club journal',image:'thunder-teammates',body:`<p>It has been a busy week for the Thunder. Zoe Bennett (#11) kept the passing drills moving, Harper Chen (#4) won Wednesday’s crossbar challenge, and goalkeeper Mateo Ruiz (#1) earned the loudest cheer at the Community Cup.</p><p>“The best part was hearing everyone behind the goal,” Mateo said. Coach K praised the team’s communication and Casey Selvin’s help welcoming newer players.</p><h2>Small victories</h2><p>Every water bottle made it home on Wednesday. Almost every cone did. Harper’s missing library book turned up under the equipment bag.</p><h2>Boots with another season in them</h2><p>The Sunday boot swap returns this week. Families can leave clean, outgrown pairs on the clubhouse shelf. Any remaining boots will be offered at the next welcome session.</p><p>More photos and player updates on <a href="#/profile/thunder">the club’s Frame page</a>.</p>`};
ARTICLES.roster.body+=`<h2>More from the squad</h2><p><a href="#/profile/zoe">Zoe Bennett · #11</a> brings pace on the wing. <a href="#/profile/mateo">Mateo Ruiz · #1</a> keeps everyone talking in goal. <a href="#/profile/harper">Harper Chen · #4</a> reads the game from the back line.</p>`;
